# Internal planning docs and design reference — not published to the repo
ai_documentation/
mockup_images/

# Agent working protocol. Lives at the root so Claude Code loads it automatically
# (that's filesystem-based, so gitignoring it doesn't stop it loading), but stays
# unpublished like the planning docs it points at.
/CLAUDE.md

# Local automation harness: the scheduled headless runner, its prompt, and its run logs.
# Deliberately machine-local. It drives this one checkout, its logs carry raw session output,
# and its commit/push/PR step is a local override of CLAUDE.md's hand-back rule that should
# never look like published project policy. (The `logs` pattern further down already covered
# .automation/logs/; this covers the scripts too.)
/.automation/

